{"id":"mahabharata-7-139","work":"mahabharata","part":7,"partName":"द्रोणपर्व","partNameEn":"Drona Parva","unit":139,"title":"एकोनचत्वारिंशदधिकशततमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 139 · Night: the lit battlefield","summary":{"en":"As the field is lit, heroes meet again, and Dhritarashtra asks who protected Drona's flanks and who the Pandava champions were. Sanjaya says he has never seen such a battle.","kn":"ರಣಭೂಮಿ ಬೆಳಗಿದಾಗ ವೀರರು ಮತ್ತೆ ಎದುರಾಗುತ್ತಾರೆ; ದ್ರೋಣನ ಪಾರ್ಶ್ವಗಳನ್ನು ಯಾರು ಕಾದರು, ಪಾಂಡವ ವೀರರು ಯಾರೆಂದು ಧೃತರಾಷ್ಟ್ರ ಕೇಳುತ್ತಾನೆ. ಇಂತಹ ಯುದ್ಧ ಹಿಂದೆಂದೂ ಕಂಡಿಲ್ಲವೆಂದು ಸಂಜಯ ಹೇಳುತ್ತಾನೆ.","hi":"रणभूमि जगमगाने पर वीर फिर भिड़ते हैं, और धृतराष्ट्र पूछते हैं कि द्रोण के पार्श्वों की रक्षा किसने की और पाण्डव वीर कौन थे। संजय कहते हैं कि ऐसा युद्ध पहले कभी नहीं देखा।","te":"రణభూమి వెలిగాక వీరులు మళ్లీ తలపడతారు; ద్రోణుని పక్కలను ఎవరు కాపాడారో, పాండవ వీరులు ఎవరో ధృతరాష్ట్రుడు అడుగుతాడు. ఇలాంటి యుద్ధం ఎన్నడూ చూడలేదని సంజయుడు అంటాడు.","ta":"களம் ஒளிர்ந்ததும் வீரர் மீண்டும் மோத, த்ரோணரின் பக்கங்களைக் காத்தவர் யார், பாண்டவ வீரர் யார் என்று த்ருதராஷ்டிரன் கேட்கிறான். இப்படிப்பட்ட போரை முன்பு கண்டதில்லை என்று சஞ்சயன் கூறுகிறான்.","ml":"രംഗം പ്രകാശിക്കുമ്പോൾ വീരന്മാർ വീണ്ടും ഏറ്റുമുട്ടുന്നു; ദ്രോണരുടെ പാർശ്വങ്ങളെ ആരാണ് സംരക്ഷിച്ചതെന്നും പാണ്ഡവ യോദ്ധാക്കൾ ആരെല്ലാമായിരുന്നുവെന്നും ധൃതരാഷ്ട്രർ ചോദിക്കുന്നു. ഇത്രയും ഭയങ്കരമായ യുദ്ധം താൻ കണ്ടിട്ടില്ലെന്ന് സഞ്ജയൻ പറയുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 7.139; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Tue Sep 22 2026","sections":[{"title":"घटोत्कचवधपर्व","titleEn":"Ghatotkachavadha Parva (Slaying of Ghatotkacha)","verses":[{"text":"संजय उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Sanjaya said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"प्रकाशिते तथा लोके रजसा च तमोवृते ।\nसमाजग्मुरथो वीराः परस्परवधैषिणः ॥","meaning":{"en":"When the world was lit, though covered with dust and darkness, the heroes came together, each wanting to kill the others."}},{"n":2,"text":"ते समेत्य रणे राजञ्शस्त्रप्रासासिधारिणः ।\nपरस्परमुदैक्षन्त परस्परकृतागसः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Meeting in battle, O king, bearing swords, spears and darts, they looked at one another, each having done wrong to the other."}},{"n":3,"text":"प्रदीपानां सहस्रैश्च दीप्यमानैः समन्ततः ।\nविरराज तदा भूमिर्द्यौर्ग्रहैरिव भारत ॥","meaning":{"en":"With thousands of torches blazing everywhere, the earth shone then like the sky with its planets, Bharata."}},{"n":4,"text":"उल्काशतैः प्रज्वलितै रणभूमिर्व्यराजत ।\nदह्यमानेव लोकानामभावे वै वसुंधरा ॥","meaning":{"en":"The battlefield shone with hundreds of blazing brands, as if the earth were burning at the destruction of the worlds."}},{"n":5,"text":"प्रादीप्यन्त दिशः सर्वाः प्रदीपैस्तैः समन्ततः ।\nवर्षाप्रदोषे खद्योतैर्वृता वृक्षा इवाबभुः ॥","meaning":{"en":"All the quarters were lit on every side by those torches; the trees seemed covered with fireflies on a rainy evening."}},{"n":6,"text":"असज्जन्त ततो वीरा वीरेष्वेव पृथक्पृथक् ।\nनागा नागैः समाजग्मुस्तुरगाः सह वाजिभिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then heroes clung to heroes separately; elephants met elephants, and horses met horses."}},{"n":7,"text":"रथा रथवरैरेव समाजग्मुर्मुदान्विताः ।\nतस्मिन्रात्रिमुखे घोरे पुत्रस्य तव शासनात् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Chariots met the best of chariots with delight, in that terrible beginning of the night, by your son's command."}},{"n":8,"text":"ततोऽर्जुनो महाराज कौरवाणामनीकिनीम् ।\nव्यधमत्त्वरया युक्तः क्षपयन्सर्वपार्थिवान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Arjuna, great king, hurried, scattered the Kaurava army and wore down all the kings."}},{"text":"धृतराष्ट्र उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Dhritarashtra said:"}},{"n":9,"text":"तस्मिन्प्रविष्टे संरब्धे मम पुत्रस्य वाहिनीम् ।\nअमृष्यमाणे दुर्धर्षे किं व आसीन्मनस्तदा ॥","meaning":{"en":"When he entered the army of my son, furious and unforgiving, hard to withstand, what was your state of mind then?"}},{"n":10,"text":"किममन्यन्त सैन्यानि प्रविष्टे शत्रुतापने ।\nदुर्योधनश्च किं कृत्यं प्राप्तकालममन्यत ॥","meaning":{"en":"What did the armies think, when the tormentor of foes had entered, and what did Duryodhana think should be done, the time having come?"}},{"n":11,"text":"के चैनं समरे वीरं प्रत्युद्ययुररिंदमम् ।\nकेऽरक्षन्दक्षिणं चक्रं के च द्रोणस्य सव्यतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Who went out to meet that hero, tamer of foes, in battle? Who guarded Drona's right wheel, and who his left?"}},{"n":12,"text":"के पृष्ठतोऽस्य ह्यभवन्वीरा वीरस्य युध्यतः ।\nके पुरस्तादगच्छन्त निघ्नतः शात्रवान्रणे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Who were the heroes behind him as that hero fought, and who went before him as he killed enemies in battle?"}},{"n":13,"text":"यत्प्राविशन्महेष्वासः पाञ्चालानपराजितः ।\nनृत्यन्निव नरव्याघ्रो रथमार्गेषु वीर्यवान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"How did that unconquered great archer, the strong tiger among men, who entered the Panchalas, dancing as it were on the paths of his chariot,"}},{"n":14,"text":"ददाह च शरैर्द्रोणः पाञ्चालानां रथव्रजान् ।\nधूमकेतुरिव क्रुद्धः स कथं मृत्युमीयिवान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"and burned with his arrows the throngs of Panchala chariots, like a comet in anger, Drona, meet his death?"}},{"n":15,"text":"अव्यग्रानेव हि परान्कथयस्यपराजितान् ।\nहतांश्चैव विषण्णांश्च विप्रकीर्णांश्च शंससि ।\nरथिनो विरथांश्चैव कृतान्युद्धेषु मामकान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"You speak of the enemy as calm and unbeaten; you tell of my men being slain, dejected and scattered, charioteers made chariotless in the battles."}},{"text":"संजय उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Sanjaya said:"}},{"n":16,"text":"द्रोणस्य मतमाज्ञाय योद्धुकामस्य तां निशाम् ।\nदुर्योधनो महाराज वश्यान्भ्रातॄनभाषत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Knowing Drona's wish to fight that night, O great king, Duryodhana said to his obedient brothers:"}},{"n":17,"text":"विकर्णं चित्रसेनं च महाबाहुं च कौरवम् ।\nदुर्धर्षं दीर्घबाहुं च ये च तेषां पदानुगाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Vikarna, Chitrasena, the mighty-armed Kaurava, Durdharsha and Dirghabahu, and their followers:"}},{"n":18,"text":"द्रोणं यत्ताः पराक्रान्ताः सर्वे रक्षत पृष्ठतः ।\nहार्दिक्यो दक्षिणं चक्रं शल्यश्चैवोत्तरं तथा ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"All of you, be diligent and valiant, and guard Drona from behind. Hardikya will hold the right wheel and Shalya the left.\""}},{"n":19,"text":"त्रिगर्तानां च ये शूरा हतशिष्टा महारथाः ।\nतांश्चैव सर्वान्पुत्रस्ते समचोदयदग्रतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"And your son urged forward in front all the brave great warriors of the Trigartas who were left alive."}},{"n":20,"text":"आचार्यो हि सुसंयत्तो भृशं यत्ताश्च पाण्डवाः ।\nतं रक्षत सुसंयत्ता निघ्नन्तं शात्रवान्रणे ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"The teacher is hard pressed, and the Pandavas press hard; guard well the teacher as he kills enemies in battle."}},{"n":21,"text":"द्रोणो हि बलवान्युद्धे क्षिप्रहस्तः पराक्रमी ।\nनिर्जयेत्त्रिदशान्युद्धे किमु पार्थान्ससोमकान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Drona is strong in battle, quick-handed and valiant; he could defeat the gods in a fight, how much more the Parthas with the Somakas?"}},{"n":22,"text":"ते यूयं सहिताः सर्वे भृशं यत्ता महारथाः ।\nद्रोणं रक्षत पाञ्चाल्याद्धृष्टद्युम्नान्महारथात् ॥","meaning":{"en":"So all of you, united, great warriors, be most careful and guard Drona from the Panchala great warrior Dhrishtadyumna."}},{"n":23,"text":"पाण्डवेयेषु सैन्येषु योधं पश्याम्यहं न तम् ।\nयो जयेत रणे द्रोणं धृष्टद्युम्नादृते नृपाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"In the Pandava armies, kings, I see no warrior who could defeat Drona in battle except Dhrishtadyumna."}},{"n":24,"text":"तस्य सर्वात्मना मन्ये भारद्वाजस्य रक्षणम् ।\nस गुप्तः सोमकान्हन्यात्सृञ्जयांश्च सराजकान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"I think Drona must be guarded with all our strength; guarded, he will kill the Somakas and Srinjayas with their kings."}},{"n":25,"text":"सृञ्जयेष्वथ सर्वेषु निहतेषु चमूमुखे ।\nधृष्टद्युम्नं रणे द्रौणिर्नाशयिष्यत्यसंशयम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"When all the Srinjayas have been killed at the front of the army, Drona's son will surely destroy Dhrishtadyumna in battle."}},{"n":26,"text":"तथार्जुनं रणे कर्णो विजेष्यति महारथः ।\nभीमसेनमहं चापि युद्धे जेष्यामि दंशितः ॥","meaning":{"en":"And Karna, the great warrior, will conquer Arjuna in battle, and I too, armored, will defeat Bhimasena."}},{"n":27,"text":"सोऽयं मम जयो व्यक्तं दीर्घकालं भविष्यति ।\nतस्माद्रक्षत संग्रामे द्रोणमेव महारथाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"That victory of mine will clearly last a long time. So, great warriors, guard Drona in the battle.\""}},{"n":28,"text":"इत्युक्त्वा भरतश्रेष्ठ पुत्रो दुर्योधनस्तव ।\nव्यादिदेश ततः सैन्यं तस्मिंस्तमसि दारुणे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having said this, O best of Bharatas, your son Duryodhana gave orders to the army in that dreadful darkness."}},{"n":29,"text":"ततः प्रववृते युद्धं रात्रौ तद्भरतर्षभ ।\nउभयोः सेनयोर्घोरं विजयं प्रति काङ्क्षिणोः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the battle began that night, terrible, between the two armies, each wanting victory, O best of Bharatas."}},{"n":30,"text":"अर्जुनः कौरवं सैन्यमर्जुनं चापि कौरवाः ।\nनानाशस्त्रसमावापैरन्योन्यं पर्यपीडयन् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Arjuna tormented the Kaurava army, and the Kauravas tormented Arjuna, with showers of many kinds of weapons."}},{"n":31,"text":"द्रौणिः पाञ्चालराजानं भारद्वाजश्च सृञ्जयान् ।\nछादयामासतुः संख्ये शरैः संनतपर्वभिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Drona's son and Bharadvaja's son (Drona) covered the Panchala king and the Srinjayas with bent-jointed arrows in the fight."}},{"n":32,"text":"पाण्डुपाञ्चालसेनानां कौरवाणां च मारिष ।\nआसीन्निष्टानको घोरो निघ्नतामितरेतरम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"There was a terrible din of those striking each other among the Pandava and Panchala forces and the Kauravas, my lord."}},{"n":33,"text":"नैवास्माभिर्न पूर्वैर्नो दृष्टं पूर्वं तथाविधम् ।\nयुद्धं यादृशमेवासीत्तां रात्रिं सुमहाभयम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Neither we nor those before us had seen before a battle like that one, that night of such great terror."}}]}]}